		<narrower xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://vocab.eona-x.eu/datex-ii/dieselType-carDiesel"/>
		<source xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/">DATEX II DieselRefillPoint.dieselType (DieselTypeEnum); hub-curated SKOS rendering.</source>
