		<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#">The maximum amount of energy/fuel that can be delivered in a single session, in the unit given by datex:deliveryUnit.</definition>
		<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Maximum delivery amount</prefLabel>
