		<source xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/">DATEX II EnergyInfrastructure: RefillPoint (abstract, extends Facility); hub-curated SKOS rendering.</source>
		<type xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/">Entity</type>
		<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#">Technical infrastructure at a specific location that facilitates refilling one vehicle at a time with any form of energy (electricity, diesel, petrol, organic gas, hydrogen). Abstract superclass of ElectricVehicleChargingPoint (already modelled above) and of DieselRefillPoint, PetrolRefillPoint, OrganicGasRefillPoint and HydrogenRefillPoint (modelled below).</definition>
		<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Refill point (abstract)</prefLabel>
		<topConceptOf xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://vocab.eona-x.eu/datex-ii/energy-infrastructure"/>
		<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://vocab.eona-x.eu/datex-ii/energy-infrastructure"/>
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
	</rdf:Description>
